e:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/ControlDevice.apk) | `/system/system_ext/priv-app/ControlDevice/ControlDevice.apk` | `com.control.device` | `android.uid.system` (`1000\n<truncated 6221 bytes>\n`widevine_<SerialNo>.zip` (`widevine_<SN>_enc.bin` + `widevine_<SN>_hash.txt`) y `attestation_<SerialNo>.zip`, verifica su SHA-256, y los inyecta directamente en el almacenamiento seguro (UnifyKey / Keymaster de Amlogic) invocando `SystemControlManager.writeWidevineKey()` (tipo `17`) y `SystemControlManager.writeAttestationKey()` (tipo `66`).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 4. Estructura de Archivos Guardados en el Repositorio\r\n\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md): Este informe técnico detallado.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src): Código fuente Java completo descompilado de `AppUpgradeService.apk`.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res): Recursos XML, `AndroidManifest.xml` y código `smali` de `AppUpgradeService.apk`.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device): Código fuente Java propietario de ZTE descompilado de `ControlDevice.apk`.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/android/tv/settings/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/android/tv/settings): Módulos de ajustes de TV personalizados por ZTE dentro de `ControlDevice.apk`.\r\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
