icados TLS ([`MyX509TrustManager.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/sources/tv/upg\n<truncated 12566 bytes>\n` + `widevine_<SN>_hash.txt`) y `attestation_<SerialNo>.zip`, verifica su SHA-256, y los inyecta directamente en el almacenamiento seguro (UnifyKey / Keymaster de Amlogic) invocando `SystemControlManager.writeWidevineKey()` (tipo `17`) y `SystemControlManager.writeAttestationKey()` (tipo `66`).\r\n151: \r\n152: ---\r\n153: \r\n154: ## 4. Estructura de Archivos Guardados en el Repositorio\r\n155: \r\n156: - [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md): Este informe técnico detallado.\r\n157: - [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src): Código fuente Java completo descompilado de `AppUpgradeService.apk`.\r\n158: - [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res): Recursos XML, `AndroidManifest.xml` y código `smali` de `AppUpgradeService.apk`.\r\n159: - [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device): Código fuente Java propietario de ZTE descompilado de `ControlDevice.apk`.\r\n160: - [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/